{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban taxis/private hire vehicles from cross-border pick-ups",
        "additional_details": "No taxi or private hire vehicle should be able to collect customers from outside the local authority area in which they are registered/licensed. ",
        "background": "We believe Hackney Carriages should not be disadvantaged by other taxis and private hire vehicles (PHVs) having power to cross borders to pick up customers. The Government should ban this. ",
